name: Bug Report
description: Report something that isn’t working as expected on the site or in example code.
labels: ['bug / mistake']
title: '[BUG]: '
body: 
  - type: markdown
    attributes: 
      value: Thanks for taking the time to create this bug report!

  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Bug description
      description: Please tell us, what happened?
      placeholder: Please describe the bug.
    validations:
        required: true

  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Expected Behavior
      description: Tell us what you expected to see!
      placeholder:
        "Explain why the current behavior is a problem, \
        what the expected behavior should be, and \
        why expected outcome would be a better solution."
    validations:
        required: true

  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Steps to Reproduce
      description: Minimal step-by-step instructions for replicating the bug.
      placeholder: Go to... Click on... Scroll down to... See error

  - type: textarea
    attributes:
      label: Screenshots or Logs
      description: If applicable, please copy and paste any relevant log output or screenshots.  
      placeholder: Visuals or logs can help others understand the problem quickly.

  - type: dropdown
    attributes: 
      label: What browsers are you seeing the problem on?
      description: Select all options that apply. 
      multiple: true
      options: 
        - Safari
        - Chrome
        - Firefox
        - Microsoft Edge
      

  - type: textarea
    attributes: 
      label: Additional information
      description: Any other context about the problem here. 
      